S CSA ASNS
The purpose and objects of the establishment of the Falcon University of Sciences &Tec ology, is to promote and disseminate the knowledge and to provide education,training, research, demonstration and scholarship in such branches of learning, as it maydetermine. For this purpose, the application and advancement as well as dissemination ofknowledge in field of Engineering & Sciences, Computing and Information Technology,Textile Sciences and Engineering Technologios, Health and Medical Sciences, AlliedHealth and Sciences, Agricu re and Allied Scienoe, Pharmacy, Applied Sciences,Arohitecture and Urban Sciences, Business Administration, Public Administration, MediaStudies, Education, Social Sciences, Law, Linguistics, Medicine, Commerce and otherFaculties as may be prescribed by the Statutes. To determine courses for study at the undergraduate and higher levels in its constituents units and institutions shall be obtained andliaison with other researoh or academic organizations shall be made to achieve the targets.Further, Industry and the relevant organizations or institutions to promote public privatepartrrership, innovation and research, development, industrialization for the purpose ofeducation, training development shall be made. This Bill seeks to achieve the aforesaidobjectives.
Qamar
Member, National Assembly
2j
a

